921,reoz95,Adderall xr,"[""Adderall xr""]",False,mixed,"[""I’m 29 and just received a diagnosis for ADHD and depression. Got the meds right for the depression and feels amazing to actually know what feeling ok is like. Now I have just started taking 15mg Adderall xr and it’s not as amazing as I hoped. I feel a little more energy, a little more chatty but still lack all motivation to even get out of bed or start all the healthy habits Iv been trying to do for years. I also think I may just need a higher dosage but I don’t really know how I should feel on it.""]",author,False,"Mixed sentiment: positive for energy/chatty feeling, negative for lack of motivation and unmet expectations."
