1263,rbxzqs,methylphenidate,"[""slow-release methylphenidate"", ""methylphenidate""]",False,mixed,"[""I was happy with 90, but i was curious to see if i could get more out of 108."", ""I don't think I've felt an increase in energy, concentration or ability to get an overview."", ""I've been super prone to stress and anxiety and burnout. More so than usual. I've been nauseous around food a lot and my heart has been racing, in the same manner as the startup phase of a new dose, just to a lesser degree. It's been affecting me a lot, i just attributed it to outside factors and didn't think it could be the meds.""]",author,False,"Mixed sentiment: author expresses initial curiosity about benefit, but later reports no improvement and negative side effects. No clear positive outcome reported."
