1383,rb8ha2,Strattera,"[""Strattera""]",False,mixed,"[""I was on 10mg of Strattera for a few months, and upped to 40mg about six weeks ago. I've been on Bupropion since 2016."", ""Getting used to the 10mg of Strattera was rough. Depression hit and lasted for several weeks, and got notably pronounced during my period."", ""When I went up to the 40mg of Strattera and the depression hit again, I took my Bupropion to that higher dose full-time."", ""I'm not quite ready to call Strattera a failure, but I also can't be out of commission for a week out of every month."", ""I can tell Strattera is at least doing something.""]",author,False,"Mixed sentiment: author reports negative effects (depression, menstrual exacerbation) but also acknowledges some benefit (‘at least doing something’)."
1383,rb8ha2,Bupropion,"[""Bupropion""]",False,positive,"[""My psych had me up my Bupropion dose for that week, and it helped."", ""When I went up to the 40mg of Strattera and the depression hit again, I took my Bupropion to that higher dose full-time."", ""I still have room to up my Bupropion dose during that week, but I'm worried it'll turn into a fighting-the-depression arms race.""]",author,False,Positive sentiment: author attributes benefit to Bupropion during depressive episodes.
