1790,r7y1mc,Adderall XR,"[""Adderall XR""]",False,uncertain,"[""I've sort of read a lot of concerning things about this combination. to my surprise, neither the doctor or the pharmacy had anything to say about interactions, however. even the internet is largely void of information from most sources, such as the drug manufacturers themselves.""]",author,True,author expresses concern but does not explicitly endorse or reject the combination; sentiment is ambiguous due to conflicting online information and personal anxiety.
