2724,r0m128,Adderall,"[""Adderall""]",False,positive,"[""I'm taking 5mg of instant release twice a day."", ""I'm taking this as a good sign so far."", ""I'm certainly not experiencing greater anxiety(less actually) and I don't get the feeling at all that it has increased my pulse or BP. I feel a lot more relaxed and feel like I'll be able to sleep better.""]",author,False,Author explicitly reports positive effects and compares to prior medication failure.
