3202,qwrqbk,vyvanse,"[""vyvanse""]",False,mixed,"[""It has greatly reduced my adhd symptoms and allowed me to focus during the first 3-4 hours after taking it. However, after 4 hours I feel incredibly tired and zoned out and am basically useless and am unable to function (worse than without medication). I also usually have a mild headache and some irritability.""]",author,False,"Mixed sentiment: positive for symptom reduction, negative for post-dose crash and functional impairment."
