3647,qt9ay1,Dextromethorphan,"[""Dextromethorphan""]",False,negative,"[""I felt so weird after taking it. Has anyone else had interactions like this? I felt extremely high, like I was floating, did not like it— was kind of scary. Trippy""]",author,False,Author explicitly reports negative subjective experience.
