4147,qpg3pn,Concerta,"[""Concerta(27mg)""]",True,neutral,"[""Anyone have issues with having a cold and Concerta(27mg) not being as effective?  Im finding not getting the usual lift and focus and think maybe it is the cold?""]",author,True,"Author expresses uncertainty about whether the reduced effectiveness is due to the cold or the medication, without explicitly endorsing or rejecting the drug's efficacy."
4233,qorp73,Vraylar,"[""Vraylar""]",False,mixed,"[""The psychiatrist suggested it could be the Vraylar I'm on, so we reduced the dose (more on that in a bit)."", ""Since reducing the dose of my Vraylar from 3mg to 1.5mg (it has been about a week), I noticed that I'm no longer stuck in bed because I'm tired like it was before. Now I feel stuck because I physically cannot get up, like my body is paralyzed.""]",author,False,Mixed sentiment: author reports initial benefit (reduced tiredness) but now reports negative effect (paralysis).
