5007,qhw4fu,Adderall XR,"[""Adderall XR"", ""10mg of Adderall"", ""20mg""]",True,mixed,"[""10mg of adderall didn’t do anything, 20mg increases my anxiety"", ""I was on 10mg of Adderall XR for a little over a week but noticed it changed pretty much nothing. If anything it made me feel kind of tired and almost slowed me down in a way."", ""I notified my doctor at the suggestion of a psychiatrist and he had informed me to start talking 2 of the 10mg capsules in the morning. So, starting yesterday I moved up to 20mg. My ability to focus the entire day was pretty insane."", ""I literally focused so long yesterday doing work I forgot to eat dinner."", ""So now I don’t know what to do. Do I not have ADD? Should I go back to taking 10mg for now? Stop entirely?""]",author,True,"Mixed sentiment: positive for focus, negative for anxiety and fear of medication, with uncertainty about diagnosis and dosage adjustment."
5045,qhmwy0,Concerta,"[""Concerta""]",False,negative,"[""I forgot to take the Concerta I have because I was self conscious about having the medication rattle in my pants pocket and people figuring out what it was.""]",author,False,"explicitly named medication with clear negative sentiment due to self-consciousness and social concern, not efficacy or side effects"
