5114,qh5yqu,Vyvanse,"[""vyvanse""]",False,negative,"[""Today is my first day starting vyvanse… Since noon my resting heart rate has been 120-140 even after laying in bed for several hours.""]",author,False,author reports adverse effect (elevated heart rate) and expresses frustration with medical response.
5228,qgaxo2,Wellbutrin,"[""Wellbutrin""]",False,negative,"[""I'm still not back to my better self. Even things that have been fueled by my ADHD, like long hours of gaming, have come down to a few minutes of playing before it loses meaning to me. That means I haven't even opened my online schoolwork or shown up at all. I feel like I'm going crazy playing catch up. I don't even function like a normal human who could shower and brush teeth and not lay in bed and run an errand in the city and do a little bit of schoolwork in one day with no problem.""]",author,False,"author explicitly states dissatisfaction with Wellbutrin's effect, despite being on it for months"
