5639,qck4fe,Adderall,"[""Adderall""]",False,positive,"[""Adderall mainly helps  bc the eurohoria."", ""I come off a lot more confident  at work on meds which makes people like me more of course bc I’m not annoyingly unsure of everything I say."", ""I feel like I don’t act weird on adderall- I stop having RSD and am able to tell myself that the way someone talked to me isn’t an attack on me when usually I’d feel hurt."", ""I don’t feel the need to act weird to connect w ppl and show them real me."", ""I do a better job at working w out hesitation."", ""I also don’t hesitate as much to make a joke when it comes to mind."", ""I connect w people more."", ""I rlly like how when someone walks into work my mind does question I imma get them or my coworker will. But it’s much more relaxed and I usually end up going for it."", ""When someone hands me things at work  my mind goes back and fourth “do I grab do I not grab” and on addy I usually end up it."", ""My anxiety is bad but I made much better choices today.""]",author,False,explicitly named medication with clear positive sentiment attributed to author's experience
