6043,q9bucx,Vyvanse,"[""Vyvanse""]",False,negative,"[""so I started taking Vyvanse (low dose 20mg) about a week ago, since day one I haven't felt any difference besides nausea, sweating, and making my hands and feet cold."", ""I was on ritalin before but it wasn't too good since I metabolized it too fast and the crashes were too harsh."", ""My psych upped to 40mg Vyvanse I still don't get any benefit from it, I don't feel any changes mentally and my brain fog has increased, I can't start or finish tasks and I'm getting super easily distracted, I feel even more stuck than without the med."", ""With 40mg I noticed I've got no appetite and I don't eat until like 7 hours after taking the med.""]",author,False,explicitly named medication with clear negative evaluation based on symptoms and lack of benefit
6135,q8qt19,effexor,"[""effexor""]",True,negative,"[""I'm not diagnosed, but I'm in the process of, and several psychologists and a psychiatrist have told me I do present the symptoms. The thing is that psychiatrist prescribed me effexor (which may be worsening my symptoms, idk)""]",author,True,"author attributes negative sentiment to the medication based on personal experience, but medication identity is uncertain (brand name 'effexor' may be venlafaxine, but not confirmed)."
