6572,q4o6af,Adderall XR,"[""Adderall XR 5mg""]",False,positive,"[""Day 2 on Adderall.  I'm definitely noticing less anxiety and less of feeling overwhelmed by all the things."", ""I'm noticing that processing steps in a task is a lot easier too, and I'm not getting distracted and overwhelmed by all the other stuff around me while I do that task."", ""So so far, so good.  Hopefully this trend of unbotheredness continues and I'm able to function like an actual adult more!""]",author,False,explicitly named medication with clear positive evaluation based on observed functional improvement and reduced anxiety.
